&lt;/figcaption>&lt;/figure></description></item><item><title>Ph.D. Proposal Defense</title><link>https://hongyx11.github.io/news/predefenseproposal/</link><pubDate>Mon, 22 Aug 2022 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://hongyx11.github.io/news/predefenseproposal/</guid><description>&lt;p>I just passed my Ph.D. Proposal Defense today 🎉&lt;/p>
&lt;p>At 5 p.m. to 7 p.m. Saudi Time, 22nd Aug, 2022, I presented my proposal&lt;/p>
&lt;hr>
&lt;p>&lt;strong>Exploiting Data Sparsity in Matrix Algorithms for Adaptive Optics and Seismic Redatuming&lt;/strong>&lt;/p>
&lt;hr>
&lt;p>I present &lt;a href="https://hongyx11.github.io/publication/slm/">SLM algorithm&lt;/a>, &lt;a href="https://hongyx11.github.io/publication/tlrmvm/">TLR-MVM algorithm&lt;/a>
,
&lt;a href="https://hongyx11.github.io/publication/batchedtlrmvm/">Batched TLR-MVM algorithm&lt;/a> and
Mixed Precision TLR-MVM algorithm (submitted to ACM TOMS) during the presentation.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>Thanks my committees for helping me get through the Ph.D. proposal! I feel very lucky to have their support.&lt;/p>
&lt;p>I still have one year left for my Ph.D. life.&lt;/p>
